# This repo is edited on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) and deployed to a
# Raspberry Pi. Files the Pi *executes* or parses must stay LF-only: a CRLF
# shebang gives "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M", and systemd carries
# the stray \r into Environment= values.
*.sh          text eol=lf
*.service     text eol=lf
*.timer       text eol=lf
